<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Nyamazana Dlamini</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Queen Nyamazana Dlamini</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Nyamazana Dlamini was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/swati">Swati</a> queen and military leader who led one of the groups that crossed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zimbabwean-plateau">Zimbabwean plateau</a> during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mfecane">Mfecane</a>. Her forces killed the last <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/changamire">Changamire</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rozvi-empire">Rozvi Empire</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chirisamhuru-ii">Chirisamhuru II</a>, in about 1836. She later joined <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mzilikazi">Mzilikazi</a>'s <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ndebele-kingdom">Ndebele</a>, who occupied the former Rozvi heartland.</p></div>
